Your body is busy all day and all night. Even when you sleep, parts inside you keep working. In this module, you will learn about these parts.
After going through this module, you are expected to:
1. name the major organs of the human body and tell where each one is found;

Think of a basketball team. Each player has a job, but they must work together to win. Your organs are like that too! In this module, you will learn how your organs work as a team.
After going through this module, you are expected to:
1. tell what an organ system is;
2. name the organ systems and the organs in each one;
